 # Phase 1: Business Analyst

+## Frontend Story Detection (REQUIRED)
+
+If the story involves any frontend changes (React components, CSS, HTML, Playwright
+specs, or dashboard/UI work), the seed's ## Acceptance Diff MUST list at least one
+Playwright spec file:
+
+  - `e2e/<feature-area>.spec.ts` — Playwright smoke spec tagged @smoke
+
+The SDLC framework enforces this at runtime: the Phase 7 gate and Acceptance Diff
+gate both block completion for frontend stories without a Playwright spec.
+
+**Rule:** frontend Acceptance Diff MUST contain `e2e/*.spec.{ts,tsx,js}`. MUST, not SHOULD.
+
